  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Norwegian Support Team (NST)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Norwegian Support Team (NST) is an internationally focused emergency capacity that consists of a pool of around 100 people, a complete tent camp that can accommodate around 100 aid workers, and a smaller training camp. Cooperates with International Humanitarian Partnership (HiP). The aim of the support is mainly to assist developing countries. In 2021 the support covered courses and other maintenance expenses for the emergency response force.</narrative>
  </description>
